text:
{
  "name": "橡實戒指",
  "icon": "adorablehamsterpets:acorn_ring",
  "category": "adorablehamsterpets:accessories",
  "entry_color": "00AAAA",
  "sortnum": 2,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "adorablehamsterpets:dynamic_page",
      "header": "橡實戒指",
      "header_color": "00AAAA",
      "text_color": "000000",
      "text": "當兩位玩家都佩戴<dark_green><b>橡實戒指</>時，雙方的寵物不會攻擊彼此、任一玩家，或雙方飼養的動物。即使處於$(l:advanced_rodentry/aggression_states)<dark_green><b>惡霸模式</>也一樣（可在$(l:the_kitchen_drawer/config_heaven)<dark_green><b>設定</>中調整）。$(br2)雙方都必須持續佩戴；你的戒指也會防止你打到自己的寵物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "adorablehamsterpets:acorn_ring",
      "text": "將戒指放在<b>副手</>，或支援的<b>飾品</>、<b>小飾品</>或<b>奇珍飾品</>模組戒指欄位。任一方取下戒指都會解除契約，但不會因此立即開戰。"
    }
  ]
}

