text:
{
  "name": "敵對狀態",
  "icon": "minecraft:tnt",
  "category": "adorablehamsterpets:advanced_rodentry",
  "entry_color": "00AAAA",
  "sortnum": 6,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "adorablehamsterpets:dynamic_page",
      "header": "敵對狀態",
      "header_color": "00AAAA",
      "text": "有些時候，你的小傢伙<i>太</>喜歡防著你，或者不夠熱情。$(br2)好訊息是：它們的胃袋可以輕鬆控制大腦。你可以用美味的食物永久轉變它們的$(br)   敵對狀態。",
      "text_color": "000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "adorablehamsterpets:dynamic_page_no_header",
      "text": "$(br)倉鼠正在攻擊？餵牠一朵$(l:accessories/flowers)<dark_green><b>花</>，清除仇恨並安撫牠。平靜時再餵一次，就能啟用<b>和平模式</>。$(br)<gold><b>{NEUTRAL_ITEM}</>＝<i>「恢復原廠設定」</>，回到中立。$(br)<gold><b>{MENACE_ITEM}</>會啟用<b>惡霸模式</>，獵殺怪物及其他你在$(l:the_kitchen_drawer/config_heaven)<dark_green><b>設定</>中指定的目標。"
    }
  ]
}

